  "details": "I can't find anything referencing this already on the canny, but I would like to suggest changing the friend color away from yellow or outright removing the color in general. From a design point of view and according to most color theory, yellow is rarely a good choice for something you see extremely often, as it's known to cause negative feelings such as frustration, unease, and anger. Yellow being a color that attracts attention(which I assume is the intent in keeping it) is because humans already naturally associate it with something negative needing attention. \n\nIt could be argued that you don't see it often in some user cases, but many people I kno(myself included) are usually in isntances of friends. \n\n",
